            "url": "https://x.com/x-user-1/status/2096197712869802087",
            "content": {
              "text": "WHAT THE F*CK, 12 GROK BOTS MERGED 1,283 COMMITS IN 24 HOURS AND NOT ONE HUMAN REVIEWED ANY OF IT\n\n$5.61 in compute. A team doing the same sprint costs $14,600.\n\n141 pull requests closed, reviewed by agents only. 4 branches open. 0 conflicts. 0 rollbacks.\n\n3,909 tests added. Coverage went from 61.0% to 78.4% while nobody was awake.\n\n213 bugs closed. 0 reopened. 0 regressions.\n\nEvery agent owns one lane and never leaves it. ORCA on the parser. VANE on schema. KITO on the API. SABLE on tests. NOVA on UI. LARK on docs. DRIFT on migrations. HALO on perf. MIRE on security. PEAT on CI.\n\nThe thing that keeps this from turning into garbage is boring. 10 flaky tests got quarantined instead of deleted, so nothing green is lying.\n\n2,520 pipeline minutes. 28.2 million tokens.\n\n0 conflicts across 4 branches is not luck. It is 12 agents that cannot touch each other's files.",
