            "id": "2095858020018237795",
            "url": "https://x.com/x-user-40/status/2095858020018237795",
            "content": {
              "text": "300 SUB-AGENTS. ZERO AUTO-MERGES.\n\nThat is how you build a serious 24/7 repo operations desk.\n\nKimi K3 can coordinate the parallel swarm and hold up to one million tokens of context.\n\nGrok Build can inspect code, run tests, edit files, and operate inside CI.\n\nSplit the system into six roles:\n\nTRIAGE sorts every issue.\nFIX touches only bounded failures.\nTEST hunts flaky suites.\nDEPENDENCY watches CVEs.\nRELEASE prepares changelogs.\nALERT wakes the human when the blast radius is real.\n\nLint, formatting, and known flaky tests can become draft PRs.\n\nApplication logic, critical security changes, and every production merge remain behind a human gate.\n\nThe goal is not replacing the engineer.\n\nIt is replacing the engineer who checks CI at 2AM because nobody else is watching.\n\nWatch everything.\nFix only what is bounded.\nEscalate everything dangerous.",
