            "content": {
              "text": "Three labs shipped coding models this week. OpenAI tried to unplug Cursor.\n\nI'm a dad of three shipping Shopify apps with Claude and Cursor.\n\nI did not switch stacks. I tightened one loop and went back to the backlog.\n\nSteal the playbook I'm running ↓ https://x.com/i/article/2095699146527354880",
