        {
          "post": {
            "id": "2095645191982256331",
            "url": "https://x.com/x-user-55/status/2095645191982256331",
            "content": {
              "text": "XAI ENGINEERS JUST SHOWED WHAT A 24/7 REPO OPS DESK COULD LOOK LIKE WITH GROK BOT\n\ngrok bot can watch ci, tests, dependencies and security signals continuously instead of waiting for someone to notice a broken repo hours later\n\n6 bots → 300 repo monitors → 60-second checks → triage → safe patch → draft pr → human review\n\nflaky tests, lint and deterministic failures stay inside the safe lane. regressions, cves and anything touching real logic get routed straight back to a person\n\nthe system can wait for 3 clean runs, track a 95% test threshold and prepare the fix with context, but it never merges code on its own\n\nthis is the shift from manually checking repos all day to letting grok bot run the night shift while humans keep the final decision",
